! FIVE ROWS CHECK ONLY THEIR OPCODE BITS -- lines 11, 13, 17, 35 and
! 46 branch to T MREJ, T M2, T M6 and T MNG, whose addresses were
! taken from these very rows.  Every other address here is an
! independent check: T SIOXW, T ERFLG and T MIOD come from p.83,
! T IOP/T ITY/T ITYCD/T IMO/T IMOCD from p.84, T SCIX1/T SCBK1 from
! p.85 and T SCIX2/T SCBK2 from p.86, and all of them reproduce the
! binary this page prints.

